Here is my new apartment.
The apartment is small, but lovely.
A woman is at the door.
"Hi, my name is Mette," she says.
"I am your neighbour," she says.
"Hi Mette, my name is Maya," I say.
"Where do you come from?" Mette asks.
"I come from a country far away," I say.
"Are you Danish?" I ask.
"Yes, I am from Denmark," Mette says.
"Do you speak Danish?" she asks.
"I speak only a little Danish," I say.
"That is okay," Mette says. "You are new."
Now Mette and I are friends.
